WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Your story. It starts with you. Bold typography and a rotating silver form on ivory.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
The little things. The moments that stay. A couple embraces by the sea.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Made to feel. What can be hard to say. A sculptural silver knot turns against peach.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
One story. Two songs. Your words. A new melody.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
SHIA SONGS. Your story, made into a song. Two songs and lyrics, from 20 US dollars.
